# Vendored binaries and their byte-for-byte copies in test/ (served at the
# site root by `flutter test --platform chrome`). Line-ending normalisation
# would rewrite bytes git did not produce and this repository cannot
# regenerate — see web/WEB_ASSETS.md. Both pairs carry the SAME attributes:
# a Windows checkout that CRLF-normalised only one copy would fail the
# byte-parity test in web_assets_test.dart for no real reason.
web/sqlite3.wasm binary
test/sqlite3.wasm binary
web/drift_worker.js -text
test/drift_worker.js -text
